  "instructions": [
    "Dehydrate the morning glory by placing it in a low temperature oven at 150 degrees for 2 hours.",
    "In a large pot, heat some oil over medium heat and saute the onion and garlic until softened.",
    "Add the diced tomato and cook until they start to break down.",
    "Add the chipotle pepper, vegetable broth, and dehydrated morning glory to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let it simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "While the birria is cooking, prepare the tortilla strips by frying them in some oil until crispy.",
    "To assemble the dish, place some of the birria in a bowl, top with tortilla strips, and squeeze some lime juice over the top.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
